  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy for Women Entrepreneurs (AWE) - Nanny and Cleaning Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Business Group thoroughly interviews, trains, and vets women to be private childcare providers. The company aims to provide a competitive, high level of customized childcare and even provide nannies with specialties for families who desire caregivers with expertise in a specific area. The company will also provide quality janitorial services which will generate employment and revenue for both men and women.</narrative>
  </description>
